WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.940
Ichigo.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.470
Aoyama-kun...

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:09.780
It is Aoyama-kun, right?

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.940
What have I...?

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.750
What is this place...?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.700
What is this...?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.500
I did this?

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:43.430
I did... all of this?

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.900
Aoyama-kun...

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:50.360
Is it Aoyama-kun?
Is it the real Aoyama-kun?

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.860
Deep Blue is the one who did this.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.330
It wasn’t Aoyama-kun.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:09.130
Thank you.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:14.260
But there’s no changing that I was Deep Blue.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:21.610
That’s right. I, as Deep Blue, have done things that should never have been done.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.520
Even with that, I believed...

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.610
...that you would return for me.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:35.650
Ichigo.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.470
I feel it.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.620
That’s...

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.790
Is that what it was?

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:53.110
The final Mew Aqua is... in my body!

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.080
Even Deep Blue didn’t notice that.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.810
We still might be able to make it.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:11.270
If you use this Mew Aqua, the people and the lives that I hurt might be able to be saved.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.730
What do you mean by that?

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.380
Fool! This body is mine as well!

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:36.800
This Mew Aqua in here is also mine!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.120
I won’t allow anyone to use it!

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.130
Can’t breathe!

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.300
Aoyama-kun!

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.490
Take your hands off Ichigo!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:57.680
You are a part of me.
Don’t oppose my will!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.820
Stop it!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.170
Don’t you lay a hand on Ichigo!

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.450
Be quiet!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:11.280
I will protect Ichigo!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.670
Be quiet!

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.890
Aoyama-kun?

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.570
It’s too late.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:41.320
Aoyama’s consciousness has
been completely erased now.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.080
No way!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:45.080
Aoyama no longer exists here.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:03.980
From now on the filthy fools of this world
will listen to the melody of destruction!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.430
If it continues like this, the Earth...

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.960
What’s going on?

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.570
Aoyama-kun...?

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.850
You.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.900
Why won’t you be extinguished?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.100
I can’t disappear yet.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.790
There is still something I have to do!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.530
Let go!

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.250
Don’t interfere!

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.780
Leave my body!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.080
This is painful! Stop it!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.820
Ichigo, give the final blow!

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:45.760
What?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.480
Let go of me, you!

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.010
Ichigo, quickly!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.730
But... if I do it, Aoyama-kun
might also be...

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.460
I’ll be fine!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.390
Ichigo, quickly now!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:01.110
I can’t do it. It’s just too hard for me!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.070
You have to save the Earth and everyone else!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.110
Your only chance is now!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.110
The only one who can do this
is you, Ichigo!

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:09.650
But...

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.610
Ichigo!

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.410
Believe in me!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:15.880
Believe.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:18.000
I’ll be fine.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.250
Aoyama-kun.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.590
I believe.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.720
I believe in Aoyama-kun!

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.160
Ichigo.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.310
You, are you insane?

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:41.190
The power won’t appear! The power...

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.650
<i>Mew Strawberry.</i>

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.150
<i>Mew Strawberry.</i>

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.610
<i>Mew Strawberry.</i>

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.080
<i>Mew Strawberry.</i>

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.390
In that condition, you still...

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.480
I-It’s not possible!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.690
Ichigo.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.490
Everyone’s power is within me.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.170
Absurd.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.130
There is no way this absurdity is happening!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:47.640
I can’t be defeated by mere humans!

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.090
Now, Ichigo!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:09.530
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.950
Damn it!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.970
You, don’t tell me you plan to use the Mew Aqua!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:20.370
That’s right.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:25.210
Idiot. If you do that,
you will also be eliminated!

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.210
Aoyama-kun, but...

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:29.840
You said you’d be fine.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:34.800
Ichigo, I said there was something that I had to do, right?

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:39.520
Now I have to release the Mew Aqua within my body.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.600
I have to take responsibility.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:47.480
It doesn’t matter what happens to me as long as the Earth and everyone can be saved.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.190
Stop, Aoyama-kun!

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.670
I love you, Ichigo.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.150
More than anyone.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.610
You really are a fool.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.790
NOOOOOOOOOO!

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.780
That is Mew Aqua!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.680
She did it!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.250
It’s a soothing light.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.900
The Mew Aqua’s power is healing the city.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.360
Ichigo! Where is Mew Strawberry?

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:22.830
No, this isn’t the end yet!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.460
Because I will absolutely
not let you die!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.770
All of my power,
I will give it to you.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.210
All of my power.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.430
I wonder what’s happened to Ichigo?

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.990
Let’s go to Mew Strawberry.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.940
We have no idea what condition
the inside is in. Be careful.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.760
I’m alive?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:32.630
Pie.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.470
Tart, what is this?

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:36.400
Mew Power Extension.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.000
Ichigo.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:56.320
I’m alive?

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:58.820
Ichigo?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.140
Ichigo!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.770
No, this can’t be!

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.740
Aoyama-oniichan, you’re safe?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:17.900
Thank goodness!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.860
Ichigo. What about Ichigo?

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.090
Ichigo-san?

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:22.870
Ichigo-oneechan!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.320
Ichigo.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.850
It can’t be.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:28.750
In order to save me, Ichigo...

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:31.360
I don’t like this at all!

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:33.090
Ichigo-oneechan!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:33.630
Bu-Ling.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.460
Ichigo.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:38.460
Ichigo!

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:52.710
What’s this?

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.710
The transformation dissolved by itself.

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.890
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.650
The effect of the Red Data Animals has disappeared.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.990
Why did it happen now?

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.960
This is bad. This place won’t last much longer.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.620
Aoyama-san?

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.580
I’m bringing Ichigo!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.360
But how?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.970
If you jump off, you’ll die.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:19.570
Will you rely on me?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:21.280
Quiche.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.510
Because Ichigo saved me...

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.840
Think of this as repayment.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.170
What are you doing?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.750
Hurry up and get out of there.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.170
Pie, let’s go.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.800
Quiche can’t do this by himself.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:39.280
There’s not much time. Let’s hurry!

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:42.580
Taru-taru.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:43.400
Pie-san.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:47.430
There is still some power left in this last bit of Mew Aqua.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.440
With this we can certainly save our home planet.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:53.120
So in order to save Ichigo, who risked her life for us...

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:58.670
Ichigo, thank you.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:10.720
If this big thing falls, this time Tokyo would be no more!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.720
We will turn it into particles and annihilate it.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.060
What’s that?

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.640
That was definitely Taru-taru and the others.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.850
They did this for us so there would be no more damage.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:34.670
Pie-san.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.980
Everyone! Are you okay?

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:39.840
Ichigo!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.990
Why did this happen?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.140
Ichigo.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.770
Aoyama... kun?

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.890
Good morning, my princess.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.700
Aoyama-kun!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:37.540
Ichigo!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.800
Ichigo-san!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.230
Everything worked out!

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:48.150
Minto! Bu-Ling! Retasu! Zakuro-san!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:54.080
Everyone, I was able to see it. I was able
to see Aoyama-kun’s smile again.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.470
They did it! Ichigo is alive!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:07.920
Thank goodness!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.240
Should we return to Earth again?

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.910
Shut up. It’s alright. That girl.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.210
So, let’s hurry.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.850
I see. The effect disappeared.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.880
I guess that means our duty is done.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.960
From now on, I will live as a normal, super rich girl.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.860
If you add “super,” it’s not “normal.”

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:36.030
It’s really great how it’s worked out
for Ichigo-san and Aoyama-san.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:41.320
From now on, I’ll always be
by Aoyama-kun’s side...

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.500
As a normal girl.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.250
I won’t let you go. Never again.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.080
I also won’t leave you.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.750
Wonderful. Wonderful.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.180
Well, it’s about time to start preparing the tea.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:59.490
For the Earth’s future...
we will serve?

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.900
Oh no! I’m late! I’m late!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.410
Shin-chan! Briefcase! Briefcase!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.310
Oh no! Oh no! Thank you, Sakura.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:22.120
Thanks to those girls who call themselves
Tokyo Mew Mew, I run late every morning!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.020
That’s right.
They made that giant forest.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.450
I wonder when the trains can operate again?

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.450
Sorry, Dad.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.640
Ichigo-san.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.670
Retasu.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:49.170
Hello. Somehow my feet just brought
me here without thinking.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.900
Even though the shop is closed. It’s strange.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:58.250
It’s great that everything has returned to
normal, but it also feels a bit boring.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.540
Oh, I see you’re as hot-blooded as ever.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.000
Minto.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.320
Great to see you again.

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:07.030
What do you mean, “hot-blooded”?

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:10.160
“It’s a bit boring” when the fighting is finally over,

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.330
is evidence of your hot blooded-ness.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:14.840
Sharp insults just like always.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.800
Oneechans! Been a while!

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.080
Bu-Ling.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.810
Oneesama.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.280
It’s nostalgic, isn’t it?

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:30.080
Just until recently we
were working here.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:34.060
I don’t think I will ever live like the
common people in my life again.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:35.290
It’s unfortunate.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.790
You...

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:40.700
Where did Shirogane and Akasaka-oniichan go?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:45.060
Just after saying the shop is closed,
where did they go?

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:49.170
You came at a good time.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:52.200
Shirogane, you were here?

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.210
Something made me curious,
so I wanted to investigate it.

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.710
What was it?

00:17:57.710 --> 00:17:58.510
Ryou.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.870
Akasaka-san!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.870
Akasaka-oniichan!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.880
Everyone, it’s nice to see you all again.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.000
How was it?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.880
It’s just as you predicted, Ryou.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.380
It just appeared.

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.600
What in the world just appeared?

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.610
The new enemy.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.130
Immediately head to the location.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:16.130
Wait a second.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.640
We’ve just returned to
being normal girls.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.630
Even if you say it, we can’t fight.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.630
That’s...

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:25.440
Ichigo, look at Bu-Ling’s forehead.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:28.810
There’s a mark.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.540
Don’t tell me all of us!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.380
Oneesama, it’s there!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.960
At that time, the effect of the Red Data Animals...

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:45.640
...was only lost temporarily due to the influence of the Mew Aqua.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.270
Confirmation is over. Now, go, go!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.600
Please give me a break.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.050
It’s fun!

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:54.300
Bu-Ling will fight again!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.300
Well, I guess there’s no point in worrying about it!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.240
Everyone, let’s go!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.740
Tokyo Mew Mew, GO!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:11.670
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.820
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:25.330
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.600
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:41.280
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:18.750
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll serve you ~nya!
